    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Killing Llanowar Elves with Requiting Hex while Badgermole Cub is on the stack. The Cub is a higher-value target (2/2 body with mana-doubling ability) and also has MV 2, making it a legal Requiting Hex target. The Cub's ETB earthbend triggers regardless, but saving the Hex for the Cub removes the bigger body and the creature-mana-doubling ability.",
