      "description": "GPT4om Libby used Requiting Hex to destroy Starting Town (a 1/1 animated land) instead of Llanowar Elves (a 1/1 mana dork). Starting Town is an earthbent land - when it dies, it returns to the battlefield tapped as a regular land, so destroying it doesn't actually remove any permanent from the board. The opponent loses the 1/1 body but gets the land back. Destroying Llanowar Elves would permanently remove a mana dork, denying the opponent mana acceleration. Alternatively, Badgermole Cub (mana value 2) is also a valid target and would be a permanent removal of a 2/2 creature body. Given that Libby is at 7 life and needs to reduce the opponent's board pressure, killing the Badgermole Cub (removing a real 2/2 threat permanently) or at minimum the Llanowar Elves (removing mana acceleration permanently) would have been better than killing an animated land that just comes back.",
